Create a Verilog module based on the following description. Assume signals are positive clock/clk edge triggered unless otherwise stated. Assume that the D flip-flops are initially reset to zero before the machine begins.

// Construct a circuit as follows:
// Input g goes to a two-input XOR gate, a two-input OR gate, and a two-input NOR gate. The outputs of these gates go to D flip-flops. The outputs of the D flip-flops are connected to a three-input AND gate, whose output is H.
